    "description": "<p>You tap into the hot-blooded nature of the Uzumaki, causing your hair to float, your eyes to glow, and your chakra to wifely undulate in intensity.</p>\n<p>| #### New Keyword / Information / The Stable keyword is a keyword meant to remove a lot of text from specific jutsu. / Stable. This keyword can only be applied to jutsu with a duration greater than instant that require concentration. The Caster of a jutsu with this keyword cannot lose concentration of this jutsu as a result of taking damage. |</p>\n<p>For the duration of this jutsu, you gain the following physical and mental benefits;</p>\n<p>You gain a rank of Mastery to all Strength, Dexterity and Constitution based Skill and Ability checks.</p>\n<p>You have advantage on Concentration checks.</p>",
